  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The left/right buttons in the quick menu that are used to cycle through players in the world are displaced 1 icon over by the new report player button. This is problematic because when you cycle to yourself the report button goes away and your cursor is now pointing at a different thing (either the other cycle button or nothing).\n\nThis makes it more difficult to quickly cycle through every player in the world, which is negatively impactful to me as when I join large instances I scan through each player's quick menu page to make sure I don't have anyone's Very Poor avatar force-shown.\n\nMoving the new report button to the left of the left/right buttons would solve this.",
